    <MissileTemplate>
      <SaveKey>$MODMIS$/hIO05lduHE-La5YpDlSb4g</SaveKey>
      <Designation>SGM-H-234</Designation>
      <Nickname>ACM 1 Block II</Nickname>
      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_ABBREV&lt;/color&gt;/$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_PASSIVE_ABBREV(&lt;color=#D4211D&gt;WAKE&lt;/color&gt;) - $MISSILEWARHEAD_SHORT_HEIMPACT</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-H-234 ACM 1 Block II&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 2 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGM-H-2 body, which is a multi-purpose hybrid missile designed to penetrate point defense grids.  This missile will deliver a Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Shaped warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Passive Wake seeker.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT
$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_POS&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRACK&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

